OL,3,GNEWSAStem cell donation leads to a
OL,4,Afootball friendship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who recovered from blood cancer
OL,7,Fhas become friends with the stem cell
OL,8,Fdonor who helped to save his life.
OL,10,FDavid Nichols, 49, was diagnosed with
OL,11,FLymphoblastic Lymphoma in 2020 while
OL,12,Fliving in New York. He had visited his
OL,13,Fdoctor with "bad headaches and
OL,14,Fmigraines" that didn't go away and he
OL,15,Falso had high blood pressure.
OL,17,FOn Saturday, the Norwich City Football
OL,18,FClub supporter watched his team's
OL,19,Flatest game with Tobias Killie, 39,
OL,20,Ffrom Germany ` the man who helped him
OL,21,Frecover his health.
