OL,4,Afootball friendship
OL,5,
OL,6,FNichols said that when they met for the
OL,7,Ffirst time at the start of 2026, "it
OL,8,Fwas very strange, like we already knew
OL,9,Feach other.. we say now that we're like
OL,10,Ffamily."
